### Forbidden V9 client control field: expected HTTP 400 / COMMON_REQUEST_BODY_INVALID.
# The chat request has a strict four-field allowlist. `model`, `prompt`, `chunkId`, and
# `citationId` are all rejected; this representative request verifies the model boundary.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/knowledge-bases/{{agentflowKnowledgeBaseId}}/chat-test
Authorization: Bearer {{agentflowAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Trace-Id: af-manual-chat-test-forbidden-field-001

{
  "query": "退款失败如何处理？",
  "topK": 5,
  "maxContextTokens": 3000,
  "maxAnswerTokens": 256,
  "model": "client-must-not-control-model"
}

