### No token: expected HTTP 401 / AUTH_UNAUTHENTICATED.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/knowledge-bases/{{agentflowKnowledgeBaseId}}/documents?page=1&pageSize=20
X-Trace-Id: af-manual-document-no-token-001
